          "solution": "设针中点到最近平行线的距离为 $x\\sim U\\!\\left(0,\\dfrac{d}{2}\\right)$，针与平行线的夹角为 $\\theta\\sim U\\!\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$，两者独立。相交条件：$x\\le\\dfrac{l}{2}\\sin\\theta$。联合密度 $f(x,\\theta)=\\dfrac{2}{d}\\cdot\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$。相交概率 $P=\\dfrac{4}{\\pi d}\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\!\\!\\int_0^{(l/2)\\sin\\theta}dx\\,d\\theta=\\dfrac{4}{\\pi d}\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\dfrac{l}{2}\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\dfrac{2l}{\\pi d}\\left[-\\cos\\theta\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}=\\dfrac{2l}{\\pi d}$。",
