          "problem": "证明泊松分布的概率质量函数归一化：$\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\lambda^ke^{-\\lambda}}{k!}=1$，并用阶乘矩求 $\\operatorname{Var}(X)$（$X\\sim\\operatorname{Poisson}(\\lambda)$）。",
          "solution": "归一化：$\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{\\lambda^ke^{-\\lambda}}{k!}=e^{-\\lambda}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{\\lambda^k}{k!}=e^{-\\lambda}\\cdot e^{\\lambda}=1$（$e^\\lambda$ 的泰勒展开）。阶乘矩：$E[X(X-1)]=\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty}k(k-1)\\dfrac{\\lambda^ke^{-\\lambda}}{k!}=\\lambda^2e^{-\\lambda}\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{\\lambda^{k-2}}{(k-2)!}=\\lambda^2e^{-\\lambda}e^{\\lambda}=\\lambda^2$。故 $E[X^2]=E[X(X-1)]+E[X]=\\lambda^2+\\lambda$，$\\operatorname{Var}(X)=E[X^2]-\\lambda^2=\\lambda$。",
          "answer": "证毕；$\\operatorname{Var}(X)=\\lambda$",
